## Engineering Domains

The documentation portal is organized into 6 core technical domains that collectively support the mobile engineering lifecycle:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Mob["Enterprise Mobile Engineering Ecosystem"]

    subgraph Found["Foundations & Platforms"]
        D1["Domain 1: Architecture & Standards\n(Clean Architecture & Circuit Breaker)"]
        D2["Domain 2: Client Stacks & SDKs\n(Compose, SwiftUI, React Native)"]
    end

    subgraph Pipeline["Build & Security Pipeline"]
        D3["Domain 3: Build & Release CI/CD\n(Bitrise Pipelines & Code Signing)"]
        D4["Domain 4: Security & Compliance\n(NowSecure SAST/DAST & TGRC)"]
    end

    subgraph Delivery["Distribution & Enablement"]
        D5["Domain 5: App Distribution & Stores\n(Public Stores & Enterprise Internal)"]
        D6["Domain 6: Developer Productivity\n(Doctor Diagnostic CLI & Templates)"]
    end

    Mob --> Found
    Mob --> Pipeline
    Mob --> Delivery

    classDef default fill:#13251c,stroke:#1f3b2c,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#e2e8f0;
    classDef highlight fill:#1b3826,stroke:#22c55e,stroke-width:2px,color:#f3d17b;
